There are also other scripts on the web that allow to select arbitrary
role/race/align/gender combinations (though I don't know whether they
allow to specify percentages). One script I once used for experimental
purpose allowed for selections from simple ones like

   nhrcs NONE +ran +wiz -hum      (only Ran and Wiz but never humans)

to much more complex expressions with regular expressions. Some weight
could be introduced by duplicating arguments as in

   nhrcs NONE +ran +wiz +wiz      (33% Ran and 67% Wiz)

but the script was originally not intended to handle arbitrary probability
distributions, it was just a consequence of the implementation.

